@base = https://localhost:7033
@csrf = paste-token-from-auth-csrf
@order = replace-public-order-guid

### Keep cookies in your HTTP client. Obtain a CSRF token before each authentication context.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Identity cookie sign-in (use actual credentials outside committed files)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"email":"your-email@example.com","password":"SET_IN_YOUR_HTTP_CLIENT_SECRET_STORE"}

### Refresh CSRF after sign-in
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Products / price tiers
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products?q=CELL

### Profile
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/profile

### Set cart quantity
POST {{base}}/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"skuId":2,"quantity":1,"tier":"Retail"}

### Checkout prices and totals are calculated server-side
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"key":"replace-with-a-new-uuid","customerName":"Example Customer","phone":"0900000000","email":"customer@example.com","address":"Shipping address","tokens":0}

### Order (owner, cashier, authorized staff or protected guest cookie only)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/{{order}}

### Wallet
GET {{base}}/api/v1/token/balance

### Statement
GET {{base}}/api/v1/token/ledger?page=1

### Quote is informational; checkout validates actual products/discounts/eligibility again
POST {{base}}/api/v1/redemption/quote
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"eligibleMerchandise":990,"channel":0}

### Own POS register and shifts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/pos

### Open own shift
POST {{base}}/api/v1/pos/open
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"openingCash":500}

### Cash sale; session must belong to current user
POST {{base}}/api/v1/pos/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"key":"replace-with-a-new-uuid","sessionId":1,"skuIds":[2],"quantities":[1],"customerName":"Retail customer","phone":"0900000000","tendered":1000,"paymentMethod":"Cash"}

### Customer creates consent for a specific POS (customer's cookie required)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/redemption/pos-consent
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"registerId":1,"tokens":50}

### Close own shift
POST {{base}}/api/v1/pos/close
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"sessionId":1,"countedCash":1490,"note":"Counted and reconciled"}

### Disabled external integration placeholder, always 501 without mutation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/marketplace/shopee/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{}
